<title>USA: King World promotes LoCascio to CFO.</title>
<headline>King World promotes LoCascio to CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>King World Productions Inc said Monday it promoted Steven LoCascio to senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>LoCascio has been vice president since 1991 and controller since joining the company in 1989, King World said.</p>
<p>He has also served as interim CFO for the past two years, the television programming distributor said.</p>
<p>Before joining King World, he was a senior audit manager at Arthur Andersen LLP, it said.</p>
